---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy | Citizen Stewardship"
  description="Privacy information for this static public discussion website."
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <ul>
    <li>This is a static site.</li>
    <li>The site itself does not intentionally collect personal data.</li>
    <li>If GitHub/Giscus comments are enabled, GitHub/Giscus may process user data according to their own policies.</li>
    <li>If someone emails contact@citizenstewardship.org, their email address and message will be visible to the site owner.</li>
    <li>If analytics are later added, the privacy page should be updated.</li>
    <li>No cookies should be intentionally set by the static site itself unless required by a third-party comment provider.</li>
  </ul>
</SiteLayout>
